  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITR/T - Youthmappers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  With FY 2024 resources, GeoCenter&apos;s Youth Mappers award will support youth-led geospatial analysis, mapping, and GIS capacity building in support of development and humanitarian assistance objectives and foreign assistance priorities. This activity will also contribute to Administration climate goals by engaging youth in the access and use of geospatial and earth observation data to support climate adaptation mapping and analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
